WEBVTT

00:10:58.396 --> 00:11:00.206
And what are the bacteria up to?

00:11:00.958 --> 00:11:02.745
Bacteria talk,

00:11:02.769 --> 00:11:04.795
they make secret plans,

00:11:04.819 --> 00:11:07.642
and they send confidential
information to each other.

00:11:08.253 --> 00:11:10.932
But not only can we catch them whispering,

00:11:10.956 --> 00:11:13.423
we can all learn their secret language

00:11:13.447 --> 00:11:16.326
and become ourselves bacterial whisperers.

00:11:16.973 --> 00:11:18.687
And, as bacteria would say,

00:11:19.656 --> 00:11:22.754
"3-oxo-C12-aniline."

00:11:23.763 --> 00:11:24.931
(Laughter)

00:11:24.955 --> 00:11:26.040
(Applause)

00:11:26.064 --> 00:11:27.248
Thank you.